  "worked_solution": "Interpreting the fraction as division, we can write our expression as:\n\n$$\n7÷2\\times 8\n$$\n\nWe can write an equivalent expression by swapping the $÷2$ and the $\\times 8:$\n\n$$\n7\\times 8÷2\n$$\n\nFinally, we can write the $8÷2$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n7\\times \\frac{8}{2}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
